WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.315 --> 00:00:07.482
- [Interviewer] Thank you.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.300
All right, Pastor Chris Wolford.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.133
- Yes, sir.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.630
- [Interviewer] You're the pastor at

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.970
- At the House of the Lord
Jesus in Squire, West Virginia.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.150
- [Interviewer] And
you, you grew up where?

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.883
- I grew up until I was 11
in a Pack County, Kentucky.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:31.320
And after when I was 11, my father passed

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:32.830
and then we moved from there

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.940
to McDowell County, West Virginia

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.490
and finished pretty much growing up

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:42.740
until I was old enough
to leave home there.

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:44.740
- [Interviewer] And what kind
of childhood did you have?

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:49.190
- Normal, just like any other kid.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.880
- [Interviewer] Your dad
was a pastor as well?

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.530
- No, he wasn't a pastor.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:57.530
He was just a member of
the Lord Jesus Temple

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.420
in Iaeger West Virginia.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:06.420
My uncle was the pastor, Brady Dawson.

00:01:07.584 --> 00:01:09.884
- [Interviewer] So it's
kind of in the family.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:14.640
Your brother was also?

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.383
- My brother now he was a pastor.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:21.272
- [Interviewer] And the
Pentecostal religion is different

00:01:21.272 --> 00:01:24.510
from Baptist or typical
Christian religions

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:25.373
in what ways?

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.146
- We believe in worshiping the Lord.

00:01:30.146 --> 00:01:33.170
We believe in shouting,
speaking in tongues,

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.460
laying hands on the
sick, casting out devils,

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:38.830
taking up serpents.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:41.603
If you drink any deadly
thing, it shall not hurt you.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.280
We just believe, the Bible says,

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:49.800
make a joyful noise unto the Lord.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:50.970
We play our instruments.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:55.970
We try to what we call
press, and we call it press,

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.410
get in into the spirit.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:01.250
The Bible said, them that worship me

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.463
must worship me in spirit in truth.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:07.330
And you got to press into the spirit

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:12.330
in order to feel the spirit
of God, the power of God.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:16.860
There's a power of God
that can heal the sick

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:19.990
and there's power of
God can raise the dead.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.550
I mean, that's kind of God we serve.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.633
We serve a mighty God.

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:32.170
And we believe in, like I
said, praying for the sick,

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:35.823
believe in taking up the serpents.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:40.640
If God moves in that way,
I'm a little different

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:41.963
than some places.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:46.353
I tell all my people that come here,

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:51.400
if they do take up the
serpents to make sure

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.300
that they feel it's God that's
leading them in doing it.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.130
I don't want them to do
it if it's not of God

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:03.750
and like I said, I don't
tell them they got to.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.480
Matter of fact, I tell
them if it ain't God,

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.313
leave them alone

00:03:07.313 --> 00:03:09.683
because there's death
in this, there's death.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.050
- [Interviewer] You lost a couple.

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:16.410
- My father died in '83.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.243
- [Interviewer] From a snake bite.

00:03:17.243 --> 00:03:18.727
- Yes, sir.

00:03:18.727 --> 00:03:20.143
And my brother died.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.868
He died Memorial weekend on that Sunday,

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:30.868
Memorial weekend, late 2012

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.040
- [Interviewer] Those were
both during a service?

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:38.040
- Yeah, well, yeah, he
got bit during the service

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:43.749
and I think he lived
around nine or 10 hours.

00:03:43.749 --> 00:03:47.810
We always ask when one gets bit

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.430
if they want to go to the hospital.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:52.070
And if they decide to,
you know, that's okay.

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:57.070
I mean, you don't know,
we try to trust in God

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.910
but you don't know, you
don't know what you'll do.

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:01.050
And you know, it's easy to say I will

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:03.170
but until you try it,

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.780
but we don't never make,

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:09.290
if one wants to go, we will take ya.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.210
It's their choice.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.530
If they wanna try to suffer it out

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.800
or let whatever happen happen,

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:19.610
we'll pray with them and try to nurse them

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:22.753
the best that we can and
make them comfortable.

00:04:22.753 --> 00:04:24.222
- [Interviewer] You take
them to the hospital?

00:04:24.222 --> 00:04:25.872
- If they desire to.

00:04:25.872 --> 00:04:29.993
Now, if they don't, we just pray with them

00:04:29.993 --> 00:04:33.007
and try to make them comfortable.

00:04:33.007 --> 00:04:36.758
If they're in pain, we'll
try to pray for them.

00:04:36.758 --> 00:04:38.390
And if they're sick we'll

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:41.000
If there's something they
think they might can drank

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:45.455
to help their sickness, as
far as settle their stomach.

00:04:45.455 --> 00:04:46.932
If they want to go, we'll take them.

00:04:46.932 --> 00:04:48.232
If they don't,

00:04:48.232 --> 00:04:49.220
we'll do what we can to
make them comfortable

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:54.220
until the poison runs its
course or until they pass.

00:04:58.197 --> 00:04:59.420
- [Interviewer] When your father
was bitten during a service

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:02.135
did he choose to go to the hospital or?

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:04.252
- No, he refused medical treat.

00:05:04.252 --> 00:05:05.085
- [Interviewer] And
what about your brother?

00:05:05.085 --> 00:05:06.170
- He refused medical treatment.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.720
- [Interviewer] And you've
been bitten before too.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.662
- Been bitten five times.

00:05:09.662 --> 00:05:11.970
- [Interviewer] Five times.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:14.563
- I've been bit three
times with a rattler.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.270
- [Interviewer] During services?

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:18.103
- Yes.

00:05:18.103 --> 00:05:20.183
And twice with copperheads.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:25.853
I got bit last May with Eastern.

00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:28.082
- [Interviewer] And the reason

00:05:28.082 --> 00:05:30.120
that the Pentecostal snake handling

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:33.023
goes on is because in the Bible?

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:38.450
- Mark 16:18, Jesus was getting ready

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.593
to descend into heaven
after being crucified,

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.310
had the 11 apostles there,

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:51.730
Judas was dead so there
was 11 at that time.

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:53.973
And he gave them a commandment.

00:05:55.467 --> 00:05:56.300
He said, go forth into the world

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:58.390
and preach the gospel to all that believe.

00:05:59.487 --> 00:06:01.940
Them that believe and is
baptized shall be saved.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:05.490
Them that believeth not shall be damned.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.003
And these signs shall
follow them that believe.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.080
It may not be in order,

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.650
but it's thou shall take up serpents,

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:15.127
thou shall lay hands on the sick

00:06:15.127 --> 00:06:16.070
and they shall recover,

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.720
thou shall speak with new tongues,

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:20.520
thou shall cast out devils,

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:25.350
and if they drink any deadly
thing, it shall not hurt them.

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:27.540
- [Interviewer] I saw a bottle
of strychnine on your pulpit.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:28.669
- Yes.

00:06:28.669 --> 00:06:30.762
- [Interviewer] So you'll pass out

00:06:30.762 --> 00:06:31.960
Dixie cups with strychnine?

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.640
- Oh yeah, like I said,

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.700
that's another thing that's not forced.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.560
Some people seem to think this is a cult.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.963
Nobody's forced to do anything.

00:06:42.467 --> 00:06:47.467
And there's times that, well,
if we don't know a person,

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.513
if we don't feel like that
they should be doing it,

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.521
we believe in living a
good clean Holy life,

00:06:58.521 --> 00:07:03.521
we believe in being Holy
and living a clean life.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.440
And if we feel like there's someone here

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.520
that's not living, we won't let them

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:11.902
do things like that

00:07:11.902 --> 00:07:14.830
because I've got to watch over one's soul.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.900
And if I feel like
somebody's doing something

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.240
that the Bible says that
they shall not inherit

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.450
the kingdom of heaven for,

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:25.440
and they get bit or drank
that poison and die,

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.190
then I've got to live with
that on my conscience.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:32.670
So I try to, for the ones
that handle the serpents

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:35.550
I tell them to please do their best

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.120
to live what the Bible tells them.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.410
- [Interviewer] You're not
doing it for shock value.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.153
You're doing it because the

00:07:41.153 --> 00:07:42.780
- It's the word, that's it.

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:43.750
I didn't write it.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.760
I mean, if I'd have wrote
it, I'd have left it out.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.480
I'm just being obedient.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:53.003
And now I know this is one of
the questions we always get.

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:58.860
If it's the word and
you're supposed to do it,

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.710
why do you get bit?

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:03.780
And the only answer I
can give people on that,

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:04.800
well there's a few.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:08.700
First of all the Bible says
God's ways is not our ways.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.453
His thoughts is higher than ours.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:15.080
But we're to be obedient
to the word of God,

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.530
even we're supposed to
love the Lord enough

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.700
to lay our life down.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:21.027
He said, there's no greater love

00:08:21.027 --> 00:08:23.220
except a man lay down
his life for a friend.

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:25.193
He's the best friend I ever know.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.370
But he told the apostles,

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:32.866
he said, you go preach the word.

00:08:32.866 --> 00:08:36.633
He told them, go preach it to all nations.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.027
They went and did what he told them to do.

00:08:41.027 --> 00:08:45.980
But if you search out in history
and according to tradition,

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:50.210
Peter was crucified upside
down, Paul was beheaded,

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:53.930
the Bible tells us that
Stephen was stoned to death

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.820
preaching the word of God,

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:58.060
doing what he was told to do,

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:02.410
being obedient, but yet
he was killed for it.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:03.750
Why did that happen?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:07.300
They was just doing what
they was told to do.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.120
And that's the way we
look at it with this.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.030
We don't know.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:15.290
People think we do this
and think we can't get bit.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.640
And that's not true at all.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:19.260
We know there's a chance.

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:20.670
Every time we go in a box,

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:23.270
we know there's a chance
that we can get bit.

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:26.660
And we also know there's a
chance that we could die,

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:31.660
but we want to be willing
to be obedient to the word.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:35.010
If we feel that God is
leading us to do that,

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:38.513
we want to be obedient to that.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:44.107
And we want to be willing
to give our life if asked.

00:09:44.107 --> 00:09:46.050
And like I said, we
will get weak in faith.

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.830
If one does go to the hospital,

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.030
we don't put it it down.

00:09:50.547 --> 00:09:52.760
We don't put it down,
don't look down on nobody

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:57.580
but that's the best
answer I can give them.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:10:00.140
I don't know why he would
tell us to take them up

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:01.213
and then turn around.

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:05.760
A lot of times we get people get bit

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:08.229
because they get ahead of God.

00:10:08.229 --> 00:10:13.090
They just move out and get ahead of God.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.260
But I still believe there's times

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.883
even in the will of God, you can get bit.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:24.610
It was prophesied that my dad would die.

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:26.510
He didn't say who would die.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:29.510
It was just prophesied
that a son would die.

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:32.730
And that was prophesied,

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.463
I don't know how many times,

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:39.240
about for a solid two months
or about every weekend,

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.590
somebody would get in the spirit

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.743
and prophesy that a son was going to die.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.240
And I remember I was just a kid

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.690
but I can remember the church a talking,

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:49.903
wonder who's going to die.

00:10:50.758 --> 00:10:54.890
And then my father got bit that Sunday.

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:59.493
And like I said, he
lived right at 10 hours,

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:04.010
but you know, I know a lot
of people think it's foolish,

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:07.433
but my dad was a bad alcoholic, bad,

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:10.843
lived a bad life.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.190
And I seen him as a young man,

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:17.053
young child, give his heart to God.

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:20.540
And I seen a man that was an alcoholic,

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:25.540
mean, that beat on his
kids and whooped us.

00:11:26.648 --> 00:11:27.770
And like I said, I never got a whooping,

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:30.210
I don't believe, that I didn't deserve,

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:34.470
but I just believed due
to his alcohol abuse

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:38.840
that he went a little
overboard many a time.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:43.840
And I seen that man change
when he gave his heart to God,

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:49.170
to totally he never drunk
another drop after that.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:51.583
He never smoked another cigarette, cuss.

00:11:55.829 --> 00:11:57.660
And I mean, he was just, I seen a man

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:59.820
that was filled with love.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:03.880
And not only did it change his life

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:05.920
for the better on that part,

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:10.680
but he found something
that he loved so much

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:13.163
that he was willing to give his life for.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:18.120
And my brother passed eight years ago,

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:22.417
used to say, "If it ain't worth dying for,

00:12:22.417 --> 00:12:24.280
"it ain't worth living for.

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:28.530
And I guess that's about
the truth of things.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:32.190
If it ain't worth dying for
it, ain't worth living for.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:36.490
And I know a lot of
people think we're foolish

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.180
but like I said, I don't
force it on nobody.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:44.020
And what gets me, I guess, about our faith

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:45.400
is I don't put,

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:49.370
there's different churches all
up and down this road here,

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.520
baptists, church of God,

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.363
and I don't put none of them down.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:57.210
I don't go in their church,

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.290
or I don't go on their Facebook page

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.340
and begin to make comments.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.830
If you don't believe like I do,

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.010
if you don't take up serpents
you're going to go to hell,

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.153
or you're stupid.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:11.840
But yet those people don't care

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:17.100
to come on my Facebook page or in person

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.973
and tell me I'm foolish,
I'm stupid, I'm ignorant.

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:26.060
And that's the part I
guess I don't understand.

00:13:26.536 --> 00:13:28.960
We all supposed to be serving the Lord.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.660
We're all trying to get to heaven.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.600
We're all working on the same goal here.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.690
And maybe you're doing
it a little different

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:40.033
than I am, but we're still supposed.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.750
Jesus said, how will they know,

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:48.560
talking about the world,
that you are my disciples?

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:52.000
He said, if you love one another.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.343
We're to love each other.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:57.530
We're not the speak evil of one another,

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:00.953
put each other down, talk bad about them.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.450
We're not to do that.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:07.060
And you know, I've been hurt many a time

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:08.230
but that's all right too.

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:12.440
But I try to never, regardless,

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:15.210
of even when my brother died,

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:17.550
regardless how people felt,

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:21.623
regardless to the ones that
thought he was ignorant,

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.863
