three, 400 degrees hot.

00:28:29.010 --> 00:28:32.770
I'd crawl outside and lay
on the sidewalk to cool off.

00:28:32.770 --> 00:28:36.120
And I finally told the church and stuff.

00:28:36.120 --> 00:28:37.587
I told them, I said

00:28:37.587 --> 00:28:40.000
"I'm going to go get treatment."

00:28:40.000 --> 00:28:43.027
I said, "'Cause I guess I
just can't take this no more."

00:28:44.560 --> 00:28:47.770
Because I was trusting in God to heal me,

00:28:47.770 --> 00:28:49.384
but I also said, "Well, you know,

00:28:49.384 --> 00:28:51.547
"this is something I brought on myself,

00:28:51.547 --> 00:28:56.467
"so if he don't heal me,
it ain't like he has to.

00:28:57.527 --> 00:28:59.817
"'Cause I did it to myself anyways."

00:29:00.670 --> 00:29:05.170
But go to the doctor and
they started some tests

00:29:05.170 --> 00:29:07.920
and this test showed, it comes back,

00:29:07.920 --> 00:29:08.800
yeah, you got it.

00:29:08.800 --> 00:29:10.650
Which I, like I said, I already knew.

00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:13.560
He said, "We're going
to do some more tests."

00:29:13.560 --> 00:29:16.500
He said, "There's more
tests we got to do."

00:29:16.500 --> 00:29:18.793
I come to church, the spirit fell,

00:29:19.648 --> 00:29:22.890
the same thing, a woman come
up, began to speak in tongues

00:29:23.740 --> 00:29:26.853
put her hands right about where
the liver's at on the body.

00:29:29.370 --> 00:29:31.050
I stood after she'd done.

00:29:31.050 --> 00:29:33.270
I knew in myself, I said, God's healed me.

00:29:33.270 --> 00:29:34.180
I told the church.

00:29:34.180 --> 00:29:38.360
I said, "I'm claiming my healing."

00:29:38.360 --> 00:29:39.677
I said, "I believe God's moved.

00:29:39.677 --> 00:29:42.340
"And I want God to heal me."

00:29:42.340 --> 00:29:45.553
Go to that specialist, he does more tests.

00:29:46.490 --> 00:29:47.883
Still says I've got it.

00:29:48.830 --> 00:29:50.637
I tell the church, I said,

00:29:50.637 --> 00:29:53.270
"Well, the doctor saying I got it."

00:29:53.270 --> 00:29:55.120
I said, "But I still say I'm healed."

00:29:56.780 --> 00:29:59.010
I went back for the last test

00:30:00.650 --> 00:30:01.830
and we was going to start treatment.

00:30:01.830 --> 00:30:03.550
I go in there and I sit down

00:30:03.550 --> 00:30:05.580
and he's got all the test results back,

00:30:05.580 --> 00:30:07.400
that last test.

00:30:07.400 --> 00:30:12.400
He said, "I got good news
for you and I got bad news."

00:30:12.750 --> 00:30:14.277
I said, "Well, let's hear it."

00:30:14.277 --> 00:30:19.277
He said, "The bad news is
you did have hepatitis C."

00:30:20.820 --> 00:30:24.890
He said, "But the good news
is you don't have it no more."

00:30:24.890 --> 00:30:27.137
He said, "The paperwork I've got here

00:30:27.137 --> 00:30:29.227
"shows me here you had it.

00:30:29.227 --> 00:30:32.700
"What I've got here says
it's nowhere to be found."

00:30:32.700 --> 00:30:35.470
I jumped up off that table
and I said, "Praise the Lord."

00:30:35.470 --> 00:30:38.520
And he said, "Well, I wouldn't
get religious about it."

00:30:38.520 --> 00:30:41.000
I said, "You don't have
to brother, I will."

00:30:41.000 --> 00:30:42.810
I said, "God's healed me."

00:30:42.810 --> 00:30:46.863
And I had a brother come here.

00:30:48.968 --> 00:30:51.210
He got the church to pray for him.

00:30:51.210 --> 00:30:53.830
He got to where every time he'd eat

00:30:53.830 --> 00:30:55.580
he couldn't hold it down.

00:30:55.580 --> 00:30:56.960
He'd start throwing it up.

00:30:56.960 --> 00:31:01.150
And seemed like he said
he lost like 30 pounds

00:31:01.150 --> 00:31:02.910
in just like a month.

00:31:02.910 --> 00:31:05.100
And he said he wanted us to pray.

00:31:05.100 --> 00:31:09.690
Well, we prayed for him and
spirit moved pretty good.

00:31:09.690 --> 00:31:11.908
And I felt right then that he got healed

00:31:11.908 --> 00:31:15.271
but I wanted him to
realize he had got healed.

00:31:15.271 --> 00:31:19.130
And he come back in the next Sunday

00:31:19.130 --> 00:31:20.883
and testified that God had healed him,

00:31:20.883 --> 00:31:25.343
that he hadn't throwed up
another time since we prayed.

00:31:28.668 --> 00:31:32.370
A lot of people think we're crazy

00:31:32.370 --> 00:31:34.650
or look and think it's something

00:31:34.650 --> 00:31:37.083
when they see us handling serpents.

00:31:37.950 --> 00:31:41.550
Now I want to tell the
world, that ain't no miracle,

00:31:41.550 --> 00:31:43.240
handling a serpent.

00:31:43.240 --> 00:31:47.410
The miracle to me is
you take a drug addict,

00:31:47.410 --> 00:31:49.653
for me I was on drugs for years.

00:31:51.850 --> 00:31:53.833
Mama couldn't love it out of me.

00:31:56.960 --> 00:32:00.123
The rehab centers
couldn't get it out of me.

00:32:02.010 --> 00:32:05.670
But when I gave my heart
to God, he set me free.

00:32:05.670 --> 00:32:07.160
I come up from that altar

00:32:08.810 --> 00:32:12.393
set free from an addiction of cocaine,

00:32:13.380 --> 00:32:17.450
smoking it, you name it,
any way it could be done,

00:32:17.450 --> 00:32:19.363
I did it, and I was hooked.

00:32:20.820 --> 00:32:22.630
I was hooked bad.

00:32:22.630 --> 00:32:27.630
And within three years I lost a business,

00:32:28.930 --> 00:32:30.363
my own business,

00:32:32.120 --> 00:32:34.633
went through over $100,000,

00:32:37.920 --> 00:32:39.760
and God set me free.

00:32:39.760 --> 00:32:41.210
I come up from that altar,

00:32:41.210 --> 00:32:44.830
to me that was the best miracle.

00:32:44.830 --> 00:32:49.720
That's far more greater to me
than handling a rattlesnake.

00:32:49.720 --> 00:32:52.350
When I can see, when you know,

00:32:52.350 --> 00:32:55.310
you get somebody come to the altar

00:32:55.310 --> 00:32:57.670
that's bound from addiction

00:32:57.670 --> 00:33:01.627
or bound from a
depression, bound by things

00:33:03.540 --> 00:33:05.200
and God set them free.

00:33:05.200 --> 00:33:06.950
That is a miracle.

00:33:06.950 --> 00:33:09.523
That is far greater a miracle to me

00:33:09.523 --> 00:33:13.608
than anybody ever taking up a rattlesnake.

00:33:13.608 --> 00:33:17.223
But we serve a God that
has all power, all power.

00:33:18.250 --> 00:33:19.640
I was telling you earlier.

00:33:19.640 --> 00:33:22.750
And it was like I said, in the beginning

00:33:22.750 --> 00:33:24.630
when it comes to taking up serpents,

00:33:24.630 --> 00:33:26.700
in the beginning God told Adam, he said,

00:33:26.700 --> 00:33:28.683
I give you dominion over all things.

00:33:30.908 --> 00:33:32.760
There was no such thing as fear.

00:33:32.760 --> 00:33:35.330
Adam named all animals,

00:33:35.330 --> 00:33:36.820
even in the millennial reign,

00:33:36.820 --> 00:33:39.290
the Bible says that lion
will lay with the lamb,

00:33:39.290 --> 00:33:43.520
the child to be able to
play on a, what is it?

00:33:43.520 --> 00:33:46.040
Basically saying the den of
serpents is what it's saying.

00:33:46.040 --> 00:33:48.450
There won't be no fear
in the millennial reign

00:33:48.450 --> 00:33:50.580
'cause they ain't going to be no sin

00:33:50.580 --> 00:33:52.103
in the millennial reign.

00:33:53.510 --> 00:33:55.730
But when man sinned,

00:33:55.730 --> 00:33:57.333
that's when fear come in.

00:33:58.986 --> 00:34:00.736
And the Bible said fear is torment.

00:34:02.410 --> 00:34:05.360
And I tell people when we
take up these serpents,

00:34:05.360 --> 00:34:06.373
I'm afraid of them.

00:34:07.390 --> 00:34:09.770
We was downstairs earlier.

00:34:09.770 --> 00:34:10.720
I had the hook.

00:34:10.720 --> 00:34:12.023
I'm afraid of them.

00:34:13.170 --> 00:34:14.880
But when the spirit of God moves

00:34:14.880 --> 00:34:18.973
upon a person to do that,
that fear leaves you.

00:34:20.260 --> 00:34:25.010
Now you still know that
that's able to bite you

00:34:25.010 --> 00:34:27.810
and you still know that it can kill you.

00:34:27.810 --> 00:34:29.560
That part, you know.

00:34:29.560 --> 00:34:31.620
But the fear is no longer there.

00:34:31.620 --> 00:34:34.673
You don't care and you don't fear it.

00:34:36.970 --> 00:34:39.101
And I believe now, like I said,

00:34:39.101 --> 00:34:41.801
I've got no Bible for this,
this is just what I believe.

00:34:41.801 --> 00:34:44.540
I believe that God, when he
moves upon us to do that,

00:34:44.540 --> 00:34:48.400
he's giving us a taste of what he meant

00:34:49.250 --> 00:34:52.121
from the beginning how
it should have been,

00:34:52.121 --> 00:34:53.430
when he said I give you
dominion over all things.

00:34:53.430 --> 00:34:55.560
And Adam wasn't afraid of nothing.

00:34:55.560 --> 00:34:57.140
He named all the animals.

00:34:57.140 --> 00:34:58.280
He wasn't afraid of the lion.

00:34:58.280 --> 00:35:00.250
He wasn't afraid of the bear.

00:35:00.250 --> 00:35:02.460
When that spirit moves on us to do that,

00:35:02.460 --> 00:35:06.820
he's a letting us have a taste
of how it was meant to be

00:35:06.820 --> 00:35:09.200
and how it's going to be one day again

00:35:10.330 --> 00:35:12.470
during the millennial reign,

00:35:12.470 --> 00:35:15.323
when we'll live without any fear,

00:35:15.323 --> 00:35:17.840
that we'll have dominion over all things.

00:35:17.840 --> 00:35:22.660
And I tell people, I don't do it for show.

00:35:22.660 --> 00:35:26.560
I don't do it for nothing
but for the glory of God.

00:35:26.560 --> 00:35:29.563
And if God ain't in it, I
try to leave them alone.

00:35:31.590 --> 00:35:36.233
But my desire is to win souls.

00:35:37.540 --> 00:35:39.180
He said, come follow me.

00:35:39.180 --> 00:35:40.893
I'll make you fishermen of man.

00:35:42.601 --> 00:35:47.601
And I want to preach the gospel

00:35:47.750 --> 00:35:51.010
and tell people that God,

00:35:51.010 --> 00:35:54.350
Jesus Christ died for their sins.

00:35:54.350 --> 00:35:57.610
I see people that's addicted to drugs

00:35:57.610 --> 00:36:00.200
maybe sitting on the side of
the street and they're stoned.

00:36:00.200 --> 00:36:02.022
You can look at them and see

00:36:02.022 --> 00:36:04.730
that they just blowed out of their mind.

00:36:04.730 --> 00:36:08.000
I'm the type of person, I don't
walk away from that person.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:10.527
I don't step on the
other side of the street

00:36:10.527 --> 00:36:11.526
from that person.

00:36:11.526 --> 00:36:12.359
I go to that person and I say,

00:36:12.359 --> 00:36:16.062
I want you to know that
there is a God out here.

00:36:16.062 --> 00:36:18.553
There's a God, and his name
is Jesus, that loves you,

00:36:19.610 --> 00:36:22.470
that can set you free from your addiction,

00:36:22.470 --> 00:36:23.870
that set you free.

00:36:23.870 --> 00:36:25.870
All you gotta do is give him your heart.

00:36:27.090 --> 00:36:29.069
That's what I'm in it.

00:36:29.069 --> 00:36:32.010
I don't care if a person
ever handles a rattlesnake.

00:36:32.010 --> 00:36:33.550
I don't.

00:36:33.550 --> 00:36:34.990
I could care in the least.

00:36:34.990 --> 00:36:37.364
I believe you've got to believe it

00:36:37.364 --> 00:36:38.724
because it's the word of God.

00:36:38.724 --> 00:36:40.850
I believe you gotta
believe that it's the word.

00:36:40.850 --> 00:36:43.750
But I tell people far as doing that,

00:36:43.750 --> 00:36:46.470
if you don't never do
it, I could care less.

00:36:46.470 --> 00:36:49.530
But I just want to let people know,

00:36:49.530 --> 00:36:52.560
these people that's struggling
with suicidal thoughts,

00:36:52.560 --> 00:36:54.850
that God can give them peace.

00:36:54.850 --> 00:36:56.710
He can give them peace.

00:36:56.710 --> 00:36:58.390
People struggling with addiction,

00:36:58.390 --> 00:37:00.620
God can set you free.

00:37:00.620 --> 00:37:02.620
There's nothing that he can't do.

00:37:02.620 --> 00:37:07.124
Just give your heart to him

00:37:07.124 --> 00:37:09.424
and let him come in and work on you

00:37:09.424 --> 00:37:11.874
and let him come in and
make you a better person.

00:37:13.640 --> 00:37:15.110
I know what I'm talking about

00:37:15.110 --> 00:37:17.520
'cause I was a bad drug addict.

00:37:17.520 --> 00:37:20.093
I mean, I was one of
the worst of the worst.

00:37:22.560 --> 00:37:25.650
And if he can set me free,
he can set anybody free.

00:37:25.650 --> 00:37:27.000
And that's what I want to be.

00:37:27.000 --> 00:37:32.000
I want to be somebody that
can witness to the lost.

00:37:32.877 --> 00:37:35.200
And there's some people in our faith

00:37:37.000 --> 00:37:42.000
that don't fellowship me,

00:37:42.040 --> 00:37:44.883
simply because I don't
put on a rattlesnake show.

00:37:45.784 --> 00:37:48.903
I mean, I believe it and
there's times I do it,

00:37:50.030 --> 00:37:52.540
but my main goal is if I've got people

00:37:52.540 --> 00:37:55.180
in the house of God that don't know Jesus,

00:37:55.180 --> 00:37:57.593
I want to preach Jesus and him crucified.

00:38:00.120 --> 00:38:01.960
I believe when I get to the other side,

00:38:01.960 --> 00:38:03.640
if I make it to the other side,

00:38:03.640 --> 00:38:05.460
he ain't going to say how many serpents

00:38:05.460 --> 00:38:07.220
did you handle?

00:38:07.220 --> 00:38:10.104
He ain't going to ask
me how high I shouted,

00:38:10.104 --> 00:38:12.785
but he's going to ask me
how many fish did you catch?

00:38:12.785 --> 00:38:14.580
And I won't be able to
say I've caught some.

00:38:14.580 --> 00:38:15.593
- [Interviewer] Excellent.

00:38:17.350 --> 00:38:18.183
All right, Chris.

00:38:18.183 --> 00:38:19.490
Thank you very much for talking with me.

00:38:19.490 --> 00:38:22.050
- You're welcome, sir, you're welcome.

00:38:22.050 --> 00:38:26.960
I'm about done really
with reporters and stuff

00:38:26.960 --> 00:38:31.960
because they just, a lot of
them tell you a lie anyways,

00:38:33.150 --> 00:38:35.890
a lot of them tell you
whatever you want to be told

00:38:35.890 --> 00:38:39.817
in order to get you on video.

00:38:39.817 --> 00:38:41.740
And then they go and do their thing

00:38:41.740 --> 00:38:44.040
and put us down, make us look bad.

00:38:44.040 --> 00:38:49.040
And like I said, they
don't want to the attribute

00:38:50.240 --> 00:38:51.510
nothing to the church.

00:38:51.510 --> 00:38:53.430
And I'm saying everybody's making money

00:38:53.430 --> 00:38:57.050
and they never offered
nothing to the church.

00:38:57.050 --> 00:39:00.040
And I had told the church not long ago

00:39:00.040 --> 00:39:03.828
that I was thinking about
just being quit of it

00:39:03.828 --> 00:39:06.200
because there's really
nothing I can add to it

00:39:06.200 --> 00:39:07.853
that ain't already out there.

00:39:12.470 --> 00:39:15.157
But like I said, I ain't gonna say I won't

00:39:16.350 --> 00:39:17.950
let camera's back in the church.

00:39:17.950 --> 00:39:18.870
I don't know.

00:39:18.870 --> 00:39:21.780
But I hadn't let no cameras.

00:39:21.780 --> 00:39:24.170
You're the first in a spell,

00:39:24.170 --> 00:39:26.370
that I've sat down with.

00:39:26.370 --> 00:39:30.125
So you might've got the
last interview, bud.

00:39:30.125 --> 00:39:31.969
- [Interviewer] I appreciate
it, I appreciate it.

00:39:31.969 --> 00:39:32.885
Thank you very much.

00:39:32.885 --> 00:39:33.718
- You're welcome.

00:39:33.718 --> 00:39:35.518
- [Interviewer] It was a great talk.

